%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H9_X2_1_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "It's just\u2026 I don't feel so good, my head has been hurting ever since
      I got here. And I feel very weak."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh, dearie me! That's not good.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The two hybrids look at me with worried expressions.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, let us take a rest before continuing on our path. At least we now
      know where we are, even if the circumstances still are a mystery to me. My
      hope to see my homeland ever again had almost perished.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 1
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He's so happy to be here. I'm glad for him.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Sit down, I wouldn't want you passing out on me. Let me give you something
      that might help.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Samantha rummages through the bag hanging from her shoulder and takes out
      a small flask.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Here, drink this, it may help soothe your pain a bit.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I take the flask from her and open the lid.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It doesn't smell that yummy\u2026 But I guess most medicine doesn't."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Here goes nothing, I hope this isn't some deadly snake venom.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I take a few big gulps from the bottle. The liquid doesn't taste as bad
      as it looks.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Thank you, Samantha.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No worries, I hope it helps a little. And if you want, we can make a pit
      stop at mine as soon as we get to the village, I'm sure a proper break and
      a hot cup of tea wouldn't hurt.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That sounds lovely, actually.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Looking up at Mr. Horse, I see him agree with a small nod.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Surely, he's very eager to reconnect with his family. It's nice of him
      to slow it down for my wellbeing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Maybe I'm imagining things, but my pain has already lessened quite a bit
      after just these few moments. Some of the pressure on my head has been relieved
      and a bit of relaxation has set in.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I already feel better. I feel\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026dizzy."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Dizzy? That's not that good either.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I close my eyes slowly and take some deep breaths.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What? {playerName}?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "This looks familiar\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Before my mind's eye, I see the same colourful patterns swirling in the
      darkness that I saw earlier.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Do you need another sip?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This cannot happen again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, get back!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Alright, I'll leave you some space.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I can't let Mr. Horse get ripped out from his world again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c017f2dc9f1c531439bd28453439c861, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1694566869d14c58b2e5f19c1a06bff4, type: 2}
